{%- comment -%}
  Destination for a "shop now" style CTA.

  Sections leave their link setting blank more often than not (the theme
  editor writes an empty string), which renders href="" and just reloads
  whatever page the shopper is on. Falling back here keeps every shop button
  pointed at the product form: an in-page anchor when the product page is
  already open, the product page itself otherwise.

  Usage: {% render 'shop-link', link: section.settings.button_link %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign shop_link = link
  if shop_link == blank
    if product != blank
      assign shop_link = '#product-form'
    else
      assign shop_link = '/products/mouth-tape'
    endif
  endif
  echo shop_link
-%}
